Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:33.58,Hook,,0,0,0,,ATERRIZAR EN GTA 6 BE\NLIKE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡A la verga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:05.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me da tanto miedo, siento\Nque si toco
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}el palo, la rama de un\Nárbol, explota.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}O los cables de\Nelectricidad...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Me llevé unos cables de\Nelectricidad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo freno en el avión?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Porque presiono para\Nfrenar y no frena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, no, no se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:26.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}frenó.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:29.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Hostia, me llevé a un\Nganso!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, no sé qué era...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:33.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡un pollo!
